SQL Query: 
        SELECT reservation_time, SUM(CEIL(guest_count / 2)) AS reserved_tables 
        FROM reservations 
        WHERE service_id = 1 AND reservation_date = '2025-04-11' 
        GROUP BY reservation_time
    
